622..699 Comment "/// A buffer allocated and freed: the allocation places it live, and the free"
700..775 Comment "/// hands it back to the scope that minted it. The `alloc` clause lends its"
776..844 Comment "/// mint to a mock kernel, which fills it and hands it back with the"
845..895 Comment "/// completion, before the clause resumes with it."
